title CI/CD pipeline
direction right
colorMode pastel

Developer [icon: user]
GitHub [icon: github] {
  Pull request [icon: branch]
  Main branch [icon: branch]
}
CI [icon: github-actions, color: blue] {
  Lint [icon: check]
  Unit tests [icon: check]
  Build image [icon: docker]
  Security scan [icon: shield, color: red]
}
Registry [icon: aws-ecr]
CD [icon: argo, color: green] {
  Staging deploy [icon: rocket]
  Smoke tests [icon: check]
  Approval [icon: users, shape: diamond]
  Production deploy [icon: rocket]
}
Clusters [icon: kubernetes] {
  Staging [icon: k8s-namespace, color: yellow]
  Production [icon: k8s-namespace, color: red]
}
Slack alerts [icon: notification]

Developer > Pull request: push
Pull request > Lint > Unit tests > Build image > Security scan
Security scan > Registry: publish
Pull request > Main branch: merge
Main branch > Staging deploy
Registry --> Staging deploy: image tag
Staging deploy > Staging
Staging deploy > Smoke tests > Approval
Approval > Production deploy: approved
Production deploy > Production
Smoke tests, Production deploy --> Slack alerts: status
